librrprotocol (0.1.0-6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add salted Argon2id password hashing and verification primitives.
  * Register TLS password login and password-change wire messages.
  * Keep SHA-1 verification only for controlled legacy account migration;
    use EVP in place of deprecated OpenSSL SHA-1 contexts.
  * Link against libargon2 and build with libargon2-dev.

 -- Pripyat Automations <dangerousdevices@istabpeople.com>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 18:45:00 -0500

librrprotocol (0.1.0-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Accept and validate the mutable mesh TTL envelope field on every link
    operation; reject expired, excessive, nonnumeric and noncanonical TTLs.
  * Keep TTL outside the signed application payload so each relay can
    decrement the hop budget without invalidating the origin signature.

 -- Pripyat Automations <dangerousdevices@istabpeople.com>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 15:25:00 -0500

